#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:379
msgid "Key Parameter Descriptions:"
msgstr "关键参数说明："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:381
msgid ""
"Only the key parameters specific to this model/scenario are described below."
" `max-model-len` and `max-num-seqs` need to be set according to the actual "
"usage scenario."
msgstr "以下仅描述此模型/场景特有的关键参数。`max-model-len` 和 `max-num-seqs` 需要根据实际使用场景进行设置。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:383
msgid "**Model-specific parameters:**"
msgstr "**模型特有参数：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:385
msgid ""
"`--enable-expert-parallel`: Must be enabled for the MoE architecture of "
"GLM-5."
msgstr "`--enable-expert-parallel`：对于 GLM-5 的 MoE 架构必须启用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:386
msgid ""
"`--tensor-parallel-size 16` / `--tensor-parallel-size 8`: Tensor parallelism"
" within each DP rank. For A3 (16 NPUs), use `tp16`; for A2 (8 NPUs), use "
"`tp8`."
msgstr ""
"`--tensor-parallel-size 16` / `--tensor-parallel-size 8`：每个 DP rank "
"内的张量并行度。对于 A3（16 个 NPU），使用 `tp16`；对于 A2（8 个 NPU），使用 `tp8`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:387
msgid ""
"`--quantization ascend`: Enables Ascend quantization for w4a8/w8a8 quantized"
" weights."
msgstr "`--quantization ascend`：为 w4a8/w8a8 量化权重启用 Ascend 量化。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:388
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 3, \"method\": "
"\"deepseek_mtp\", \"enforce_eager\": true}'`: Enables Multi-Token Prediction"
" (MTP) speculative decoding with GLM-5's DeepSeek-style MTP draft model. "
"`num_speculative_tokens` (3-5) controls how many tokens are speculated per "
"step; `enforce_eager: true` is required because GLM-5 does not support "
"graph-mode speculative decoding."
msgstr ""
"`--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 3, \"method\": "
"\"deepseek_mtp\", \"enforce_eager\": true}'`：启用 GLM-5 的 DeepSeek 风格 MTP "
"草稿模型进行多令牌预测（MTP）投机解码。`num_speculative_tokens`（3-5）控制每步推测的令牌数量；`enforce_eager:"
" true` 是必需的，因为 GLM-5 不支持图模式投机解码。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:389
msgid ""
"`--enable-chunked-prefill` / `--enable-prefix-caching`: Recommended for "
"long-context and multi-user scenarios — chunked prefill splits long prompts "
"to improve TTFT, prefix caching reuses KV cache for shared prefixes (e.g., "
"system prompts)."
msgstr ""
"`--enable-chunked-prefill` / `--enable-prefix-"
"caching`：推荐用于长上下文和多用户场景——分块预填充将长提示拆分以提高 TTFT，前缀缓存为共享前缀（如系统提示）复用 KV 缓存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:390
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": \"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'`: Enables"
" graph capture for the decode phase only, improving decode performance by "
"reducing kernel launch overhead."
msgstr ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": "
"\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'`：仅对解码阶段启用图捕获，通过减少内核启动开销来提升解码性能。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:391
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--additional-config '{\"multistream_overlap_shared_expert\": true}'`: "
"Overlaps shared-expert computation on an additional stream. Note: "
"automatically disabled when `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`, as the two "
"optimizations conflict."
msgstr ""
"`--additional-config '{\"multistream_overlap_shared_expert\": "
"true}'`：在额外的流上重叠共享专家计算。注意：当 `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1` "
"时自动禁用，因为这两种优化存在冲突。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:393
msgid "**Key environment variables:**"
msgstr "**关键环境变量：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:395
msgid ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1=1`: Enables FlashComm optimization to reduce "
"communication overhead (mainly benefits the prefill path). With FlashComm "
"enabled, `layer_sharding` cannot include `o_proj`."
msgstr ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1=1`：启用 FlashComm 优化以减少通信开销（主要有利于预填充路径）。启用 "
"FlashComm 后，`layer_sharding` 不能包含 `o_proj`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:396
msgid ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO=1`: Enables the MLA preprocess fusion operator "
"(MlaPreprocessOperation). Enabled by default for w8a8 models — significantly"
" improves Decode performance but consumes more NPU memory; set "
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO=0` if memory is a priority. Recommended for w8a8; "
"w4a8 may not benefit."
msgstr ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO=1`：启用 MLA 预处理融合算子（MlaPreprocessOperation）。对于 w8a8 "
"模型默认启用——显著提升解码性能但会消耗更多 NPU 内存；如果内存优先，请设置 `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO=0`。推荐用于 "
"w8a8；w4a8 可能无法受益。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:397
msgid ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_BALANCE_SCHEDULING=1`: Enables balance scheduling to improve "
"output throughput and reduce TPOT in the v1 scheduler."
msgstr "`VLLM_ASCEND_BALANCE_SCHEDULING=1`：启用均衡调度以提升输出吞吐量并降低 v1 调度器中的 TPOT。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:399
msgid "**Performance tuning notes for single-node:**"
msgstr "**单节点性能调优说明：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:401
msgid ""
"For low-latency scenarios, use `dp1tp16` (data-parallel-size 1, tensor-"
"parallel-size 16) and consider reducing `--max-num-seqs` and `--max-num-"
"batched-tokens`."
msgstr ""
"对于低延迟场景，使用 `dp1tp16`（data-parallel-size 1，tensor-parallel-size 16），并考虑减少 "
"`--max-num-seqs` 和 `--max-num-batched-tokens`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:402
msgid ""
"For high-throughput scenarios, increase `--max-num-seqs` and enable "
"`--enable-prefix-caching`."
msgstr "对于高吞吐量场景，增加 `--max-num-seqs` 并启用 `--enable-prefix-caching`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:403
msgid ""
"For long-context scenarios (e.g., 200K), use w8a8 weight (more memory for KV"
" cache) and set `--max-model-len` to the desired context length. Consider "
"enabling `--enable-chunked-prefill`."
msgstr ""
"对于长上下文场景（如 200K），使用 w8a8 权重（为 KV 缓存留出更多内存）并将 `--max-model-len` "
"设置为所需的上下文长度。考虑启用 `--enable-chunked-prefill`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:404
msgid ""
"If you encounter OOM, reduce `--gpu-memory-utilization`, `--max-num-seqs`, "
"or `--max-model-len`. Disabling `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO` can also reduce "
"memory usage (at the cost of performance)."
msgstr ""
"如果遇到 OOM，请减少 `--gpu-memory-utilization`、`--max-num-seqs` 或 `--max-model-"
"len`。禁用 `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO` 也可以减少内存使用（以性能为代价）。"

