msgid "`glm-5-w8a8`: require 2 Atlas 800 A3 (64GB × 16)."
msgstr "`glm-5-w8a8`：需要 2 台 Atlas 800 A3（64GB × 16）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:784
msgid "Key Parameter Descriptions for multi-node deployment:"
msgstr "多节点部署的关键参数说明："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:786
msgid ""
"In addition to all single-node parameters described in [Single-Node Online "
"Deployment](#51-single-node-online-deployment), the following parameters are"
" specific to multi-node deployment:"
msgstr ""
"除了[单节点在线部署](#51-single-node-online-deployment)中描述的所有单节点参数外，以下参数是多节点部署特有的："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:788
msgid "**Network and data parallel configuration:**"
msgstr "**网络和数据并行配置：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:790
msgid ""
"`HCCL_IF_IP`, `GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`, `TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`, "
"`HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`: Network interface configuration for multi-node "
"communication. Set `nic_name` to the network interface name (obtained via "
"`ifconfig`) and `local_ip` to the current node's IP address. These must be "
"correctly configured on each node for successful multi-node communication."
msgstr ""
"`HCCL_IF_IP`、`GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`：多节点通信的网络接口配置。将"
" `nic_name` 设置为网络接口名称（通过 `ifconfig` 获取），将 `local_ip` 设置为当前节点的 IP "
"地址。这些必须在每个节点上正确配置，多节点通信才能成功。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:791
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-size`: Total number of data parallel ranks across all "
"nodes. For 2-node deployment, typically set to `2`."
msgstr "`--data-parallel-size`：所有节点上的数据并行 rank 总数。对于 2 节点部署，通常设置为 `2`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:792
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-size-local`: Number of data parallel ranks on the current "
"node. Usually set to `1` (one DP rank per node)."
msgstr ""
"`--data-parallel-size-local`：当前节点上的数据并行 rank 数量。通常设置为 `1`（每个节点一个 DP rank）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:793
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-address`: IP address of the data parallel master node (node"
" 0). Must match the `local_ip` of the master node."
msgstr "`--data-parallel-address`：数据并行主节点（节点 0）的 IP 地址。必须与主节点的 `local_ip` 一致。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:794
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-rpc-port`: RPC port for data parallel master communication."
" Must be the same across all nodes."
msgstr "`--data-parallel-rpc-port`：数据并行主节点通信的 RPC 端口。所有节点必须保持一致。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:795
msgid ""
"`--headless`: Indicates this is a non-master node. Do not use on node 0."
msgstr "`--headless`：表示这是非主节点。不要在节点 0 上使用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:796
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-start-rank`: Starting rank offset for data parallel ranks "
"on this node. Node 0 uses `0`, node 1 uses `1`."
msgstr ""
"`--data-parallel-start-rank`：当前节点上数据并行 rank 的起始偏移量。节点 0 使用 `0`，节点 1 使用 `1`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:798
msgid "**Multi-node performance tuning:**"
msgstr "**多节点性能调优：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:800
msgid ""
"For low-latency multi-node scenarios, keep `--data-parallel-size-local 1` to"
" minimize cross-node communication."
msgstr "对于低延迟多节点场景，保持 `--data-parallel-size-local 1` 以最小化跨节点通信。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:801
msgid ""
"`--max-num-seqs` should be tuned based on available KV cache memory after "
"model loading. For w8a8 on A3 multi-node, `16` is recommended. For w4a8 on "
"A2 multi-node with long context, start with `2` and increase if memory "
"permits."
msgstr ""
"`--max-num-seqs` 应根据模型加载后可用的 KV 缓存内存进行调整。对于 A3 多节点上的 w8a8，推荐使用 `16`。对于 A2 "
"多节点上长上下文的 w4a8，从 `2` 开始，如果内存允许再增加。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:802
msgid ""
"All nodes in a multi-node deployment must use identical `--tensor-parallel-"
"size`, `--enable-expert-parallel`, and model weight path configurations."
msgstr ""
"多节点部署中的所有节点必须使用相同的 `--tensor-parallel-size`、`--enable-expert-parallel` "
"和模型权重路径配置。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:808
msgid "5.3 Prefill-Decode Disaggregation (A3 series)"
msgstr "5.3 预填充-解码分离（A3系列）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:810
msgid ""
"We'd like to show the deployment guide of `GLM-5` on multi-node environment "
"with 1P1D for better performance. *Prefill-Decode Disaggregation* refers to "
"the separation of the prefill stage and the decode stage across different "
"nodes to improve throughput and latency."
msgstr ""
"我们将展示 `GLM-5` 在多节点环境下采用 1P1D 配置以获得更好性能的部署指南。*预填充-"
"解码分离*是指将预填充阶段和解码阶段分布到不同节点上，以提升吞吐量和降低延迟。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:813
#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1392
msgid ""
"For GLM-5.1's Sparse Flash Attention (SFA) backend, when using Decode "
"Context Parallelism (DCP) in PD disaggregation, enable it on both the "
"prefiller and decoder nodes, or disable it on both. Enabling DCP on only one"
" side can cause known accuracy issues."
msgstr ""
"对于GLM-5.1的稀疏闪速注意力（SFA）后端，在PD分离中使用解码上下文并行（DCP）时，请在预填充节点和解码节点上都启用它，或同时在两者上禁用。仅在一侧启用DCP可能会导致已知的精度问题。"

