#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1983
msgid "9 Performance Tuning"
msgstr "9 性能调优"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1985
msgid "9.1 Recommended Configurations"
msgstr "9.1推荐配置"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1987
msgid ""
"**Note**: The following configurations are validated in specific test "
"environments and are for reference only. The optimal configuration depends "
"on factors such as maximum input/output length, prefix cache hit rate, "
"precision requirements, and deployment machine ratios. It is recommended to "
"refer to [Tuning Guidelines](#92-tuning-guidelines) for tuning based on "
"actual conditions."
msgstr ""
"**注意**：以下配置已在特定测试环境中验证，仅供参考。最佳配置取决于最大输入/输出长度、前缀缓存命中率、精度要求和部署机器比例等因素。建议根据实际情况参考[调优指南](#92-tuning-"
"guidelines)进行调优。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1989
msgid ""
"The tables below provide recommended parameter configurations for different "
"deployment scenarios. All scenarios are categorized by use case (High "
"Throughput, Low Latency, Long Context) and correspond to the deployment "
"modes documented in [Online Service Deployment](#5-online-service-"
"deployment)."
msgstr ""
"下表提供了不同部署场景下的推荐参数配置。所有场景按用途分类（高吞吐、低延迟、长上下文），并对应[在线服务部署](#5-online-service-"
"deployment)中记录的部署模式。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1991
msgid "9.1.1 Table 1: Scenario Overview"
msgstr "9.1.1 表 1：场景概览"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1993
msgid ""
"`*Total NPUs` indicates the total number of NPUs used across all nodes. 1 "
