#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "Long Context"
msgstr "长上下文"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "`--max-num-seqs`"
msgstr "`--max-num-seqs`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "Lower (4–8)"
msgstr "较低（4–8）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "Higher (16–64)"
msgstr "较高（16–64）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "Controlled (2–8)"
msgstr "受控（2–8）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid ""
"Limits concurrent sequences. Lower values reduce scheduling latency; higher "
"values increase throughput."
msgstr "限制并发序列数。较低的值可减少调度延迟；较高的值可提高吞吐量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "`--max-model-len`"
msgstr "`--max-model-len`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "Shorter (32K–40K)"
msgstr "较短（32K–40K）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "Longer (128K–200K)"
msgstr "较长（128K–200K）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "Maximum (128K–200K)"
msgstr "最大（128K–200K）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid ""
"Maximum context length. Must accommodate your longest input+output. Larger "
"values consume more KV cache memory."
msgstr "最大上下文长度。必须能够容纳最长的输入+输出。较大的值会消耗更多的KV缓存内存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "`--max-num-batched-tokens`"
msgstr "`--max-num-batched-tokens`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "Lower (2048–4096)"
msgstr "较低（2048–4096）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "Higher (4096–8192)"
msgstr "较高（4096–8192）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "Higher for prefill (4096)"
msgstr "预填充时较高（4096）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid ""
"Controls batch size per step. Lower values reduce per-step latency; higher "
"values improve prefill throughput."
msgstr "控制每步的批处理大小。较低的值可减少每步延迟；较高的值可提高预填充吞吐量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "`--gpu-memory-utilization`"
msgstr "`--gpu-memory-utilization`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "0.92–0.95"
msgstr "0.92–0.95"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "0.95"
msgstr "0.95"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid ""
"NPU memory fraction. Higher values leave more memory for KV cache. Reduce if"
" OOM."
msgstr "NPU内存占比。较高的值可为KV缓存留出更多内存。如果出现内存不足（OOM），请降低该值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "`--enable-chunked-prefill`"
msgstr "`--enable-chunked-prefill`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid ""
"Splits long prompts into chunks to prevent prefill from blocking decode. "
"Recommended in all scenarios."
msgstr "将长提示拆分为多个块，以防止预填充阻塞解码。建议在所有场景中启用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "`--enable-prefix-caching`"
msgstr "`--enable-prefix-caching`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "可选"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid ""
"Reuses KV cache for shared prefixes (e.g., system prompts). Improves "
"throughput when cache hit rate is high but may reduce available KV cache "
"memory."
msgstr "对共享前缀（例如系统提示）复用KV缓存。当缓存命中率较高时可提高吞吐量，但可能会减少可用的KV缓存内存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "`num_speculative_tokens`"
msgstr "`num_speculative_tokens`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid ""
"MTP speculation count. Higher values improve decode throughput at the cost "
"of memory for draft model KV cache. Use `1` on prefill nodes in PD mode."
msgstr "MTP推测数量。较高的值可提高解码吞吐量，但会消耗更多草稿模型KV缓存内存。在PD模式下的预填充节点上使用`1`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO`"
msgstr "`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "1 (w8a8)"
msgstr "1（w8a8）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "0 or 1"
msgstr "0或1"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid ""
"Enables MLA fusion on w8a8 models. Improves decode performance but consumes "
"more NPU memory. Disable for long-context if memory is insufficient."
msgstr "在w8a8模型上启用MLA融合。可提高解码性能，但会消耗更多NPU内存。如果内存不足，请在长上下文场景中禁用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1`"
msgstr "`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/GLM5.md:1863
msgid ""
"Communication optimization. Recommended in all scenarios unless "
"layer_sharding includes o_proj."
msgstr "通信优化。建议在所有场景中启用，除非layer_sharding包含o_proj。"

